y. Oh, You Will Pay... / SLF Mini #11: What Kind of Man Is Rakuro Hizutome?) is TVDB S0E20 \"SLF Theater Mini #10 You'll Pay. Oh, You Will Pay...\" + TVDB S0E21 \"SLF Theater Mini #11 What Kind of Man Is Rakuro Hizutome?\" and has no TMDB episode (TMDB has no S0E17); AniDB S18 \"シャンフロ ミニ #12 サンラクは見た! / シャンフロ ミニ #13 記録: ○○秒\" (SLF Mini #12: What Sunraku Saw! / SLF Mini #13: Memory: XX Seconds) is TVDB S0E22 \"SLF Theater Mini #12 What Sunraku Saw!\" + TVDB S0E23 \"SLF Theater Mini #13 Memory: XX Seconds\" and has no TMDB episode (TMDB has no S0E18); AniDB S19-S35 (\"シャンフロ ミニ #14 天音永遠ってどんな人\" (SLF Mini #14: What Kind of Person Is Towa Amane?) to \"シャンフロ ミニ #30 宝石, 鉱石, 石頭\" (SLF Mini #30: Gems, Ore, and Heads of Equal Hardness)) are TVDB S0E24 \"SLF Theater Mini #14 What Kind of Person Is Kuon Amane?\" to TVDB S0E40 \"SLF Theater Mini #30 Gems, Ore, and Heads of Equal Hardness\" and have no TMDB episode (TMDB has none of them); AniDB S36 \"シャングリラ・フロンティア 第2クールエンディング ReoNaニューシングル「ガジュマル ~Heaven in the Rain~」発売記念スペシャル特番 in ABEMA\" (Episode S36) has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E36 is \"SLF Theater Mini #26 Making Oikatzo\", another item) and no TMDB episode (TMDB has no S0E36).",
